    "created_at": "2016-10-19T16:28:21Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-19T16:28:21Z",
    "body": "Can we first spec the `preload` IDL attribute to return the `effective preload state` and only add `deafultPreload` if needed? Basically, it would make `preload` behave like an enum attribute for which the default value and the allowed values depend on the implementation.\n",
