    "created_at": "2019-03-29T19:51:43Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-03-29T19:51:43Z",
    "body": "I know this is an old bug and probably not high priority for the parties involved anymore, but I'll note that we generally want to have reflected IDL attributes for all content attributes. This is necessary for some frameworks that only support properties (IDL attributes) and not (content) attributes, such as React.\r\n\r\nSo, I think `defaultPreload` that straightforwardly reflects is a good idea, if someone wants to prioritize it.",
